From: Luciano Dittgen <luciano.dittgen@ossystems.com.br>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:10:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] kontron: mx6ul: Include the i.MX eSDHC header

board/kontron/imx/mx6ul/spl.c includes <fsl_esdhc.h>, which declares
fsl_esdhc_initialize() only under CONFIG_FSL_ESDHC. This board selects
CONFIG_FSL_ESDHC_IMX, so the declaration is invisible and the call is
implicit. GCC 14 made -Wimplicit-function-declaration an error, so the
SPL no longer builds:

  spl.c:129:31: error: implicit declaration of function
  'fsl_esdhc_initialize'

Include <fsl_esdhc_imx.h>, which declares it under CONFIG_FSL_ESDHC_IMX
and is what the other i.MX boards in this tree use.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [no upstream]

This board lives on the vendor's v2020.01-ktn branch; mainline u-boot
removed the non-DM eSDHC init path entirely.

Signed-off-by: Luciano Dittgen <luciano.dittgen@ossystems.com.br>
---
 board/kontron/imx/mx6ul/spl.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/board/kontron/imx/mx6ul/spl.c b/board/kontron/imx/mx6ul/spl.c
--- a/board/kontron/imx/mx6ul/spl.c
+++ b/board/kontron/imx/mx6ul/spl.c
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
 #include <asm/mach-imx/boot_mode.h>
 #include <asm/io.h>
 #include <common.h>
-#include <fsl_esdhc.h>
+#include <fsl_esdhc_imx.h>
 #include <linux/sizes.h>
 #include <mmc.h>
 
